Watch files and rebuild on changes

Usage: souc-linux-x86_64 watch [OPTIONS] [PATH]...

Arguments:
  [PATH]...  Paths to watch (default: src) [default: src]

Options:
  -c, --clear                Clear screen before each rebuild
  -t, --test                 Run tests after successful build
  -x, --exec <EXEC>          Command to run after successful build
      --debounce <DEBOUNCE>  Debounce delay in milliseconds [default: 100]
      --ignore <IGNORE>      Patterns to ignore (glob)
  -v, --verbose              Enable verbose output
  -h, --help                 Print help
